    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/a8aef7ecf0a42f4387ef5ea16e91a539.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/a8aef7ecf0a42f4387ef5ea16e91a539.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany the journey of a fortune teller who shapes people's destinies through her tarot readings. Each card drawn holds unique powers\u2014build the right strategy to master fate. Dare to play with destiny and endure its cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a mystical world where people's souls intertwine with your cards. Play your cards strategically to claim points, harvest them before your opponents, and be the first to dominate the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/077a990a4fec3346d19fbb19e420c8cf.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/077a990a4fec3346d19fbb19e420c8cf.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/077a990a4fec3346d19fbb19e420c8cf.mp4?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wands, Cups, Swords, Pentacles... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambition, Love, Power, Money...</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/40e8decfa7e30811636ede779eab0b56.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/40e8decfa7e30811636ede779eab0b56.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide your strategy with dozens of different featured tarot cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the strongest deck </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies with different strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine fates in this dark world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/73cd75a0b41682f5d8c35b83d1024e11.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/73cd75a0b41682f5d8c35b83d1024e11.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/73cd75a0b41682f5d8c35b83d1024e11.mp4?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/a8aef7ecf0a42f4387ef5ea16e91a539.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/a8aef7ecf0a42f4387ef5ea16e91a539.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany the journey of a fortune teller who shapes people's destinies through her tarot readings. Each card drawn holds unique powers\u2014build the right strategy to master fate. Dare to play with destiny and endure its cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a mystical world where people's souls intertwine with your cards. Play your cards strategically to claim points, harvest them before your opponents, and be the first to dominate the round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/077a990a4fec3346d19fbb19e420c8cf.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/077a990a4fec3346d19fbb19e420c8cf.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/077a990a4fec3346d19fbb19e420c8cf.mp4?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wands, Cups, Swords, Pentacles... </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambition, Love, Power, Money...</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/40e8decfa7e30811636ede779eab0b56.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/40e8decfa7e30811636ede779eab0b56.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide your strategy with dozens of different featured tarot cards </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the strongest deck </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies with different strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine fates in this dark world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/73cd75a0b41682f5d8c35b83d1024e11.poster.avif?t=1737120433\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364480/extras/73cd75a0b41682f5d8c35b83d1024e11.webm?t=1737120433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src